*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.backup
# The installer writes a timestamped copy before it modifies anything. It holds
# every credential the original does, so the bare `.env.backup` pattern above
# is not enough — it does not match `.env.backup-20260816-011028`.
.env.backup-*
.env.production
.phpactor.json
.phpunit.result.cache
/.fleet
/.idea
/.nova
/.phpunit.cache
/.vscode
/.zed
/auth.json
/node_modules
/public/build
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
# Local object storage: masters, derivatives, artwork. Never committed.
/storage/app/sanitube
# Installer runtime state: the web installer's token and lock, and the
# installation journal. State of a machine, never of the codebase — and on a
# git-deployed install it must not dirty the tree an update will refuse.
/storage/installer
/phpstan.neon
/vendor
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
